   "file": "EpsilonEridani/QFT/Scattering/DIS/Diffractive/Kinematics/Basic.lean",
   "fix": "Either give both arguments, `add_comm K.q (deltaTarget K)`, or drop `add_comm` and flip the cross term explicitly: `rw [MX2, pX, Bilin.apply_add_self g hg, hg.eq K.q (deltaTarget K), tMom, DisKinematics.Q2]; ring`.",
   "issue": "`rw [MX2, pX, add_comm K.q, ...]` leaves the second summand of `add_comm` to be guessed from the first match, so the step silently retargets if any other `K.q + _` subterm appears in the goal.",
